      "post_subject": "Dr. Laser Sets Them Straight!",
      "content_md": "Do you think that holographers constantly stating that these Pepper's Ghost images are not holograms help in any way? Or, is this merely a way of assuaging our conscious? While one news outlet quotes Jason Sappan, there are over 869,000 views of the hologram on you tube. Also Nike has a \"hologram 360 in interactive information point\" ( [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fK56rU1vC_E](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fK56rU1vC_E) ). I think that this is beyond the control of holographers and we should simply accept that we've lost the battle and the world at large will continue to think of these displays as holograms. Fighting a rearguard action on a lost battle, I think, is futile. Just like grandpa mumbling about how he can't use computers and back in the day, people could spell and read books and wrote real letters instead of using the number '4' for the word 'for'.",
