      "post_subject": "Dr. Laser Sets Them Straight!",
      "content_md": "Actually I think it is WELL worth fighting - especially when the same rubbish is repeated by the BBC (this, \"Tupac\", the \"holographic airport assitants\" - that one by Tensator). Certainly every time they do it I lodge an official complaint since this sort of gross inacurracy and misrepresentation is contrary to their charter. You only need to win a very few of such battles with the large news outlets before they start questioning the validity of anything perporting to be a hologram.\n\nI just wonder how long it will be before the likes of Musion are brought to book by the Advertising Standards Authority for their claims.....",
